    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Appendix A: Surface Syntax",
      "source_hash": 18154970201062493824,
      "context_hash": 16414765857142910935,
      "translation": "부록 A: 표면 구문",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Appendix": "부록",
        "syntax": "구문"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912209Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This grammar collects the final Fun language in one place.",
      "source_hash": 16614208732059712749,
      "context_hash": 8434469597880076312,
      "translation": "이 문법은 최종 Fun 언어를 한곳에 모아 둔 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Fun": "Fun",
        "grammar": "문법"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It describes source syntax after layout has inserted braces and semicolons.",
      "source_hash": 15044299325644574150,
      "context_hash": 3284291787617671318,
      "translation": "이 문법은 레이아웃이 중괄호와 세미콜론을 삽입한 뒤의 소스 구문을 기술합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "layout": "레이아웃",
        "semicolons": "세미콜론",
        "source syntax": "소스 구문"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Name resolution, kinds, and typing impose the restrictions listed below.",
      "source_hash": 9891377018573772517,
      "context_hash": 3862652103034166928,
      "translation": "이름 해석, 카인드, 타입 검사는 아래에 나열한 제약을 부과합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "resolution": "해석",
        "typing": "타입"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "See [Appendix B](appendix-b-typing.md) for the corresponding judgments.",
      "source_hash": 13880652750212499258,
      "context_hash": 15033085996893796147,
      "translation": "이에 대응하는 판단은 [부록 B](appendix-b-typing.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Appendix": "부록",
        "judgments": "판단"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Reading the Grammar",
      "source_hash": 1181266542543424792,
      "context_hash": 7515347256480618871,
      "translation": "문법 읽는 법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "grammar": "문법"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Quoted strings are terminals. `|` separates alternatives, `[ X ]` means optional, and `{ X }` means zero or more repetitions.",
      "source_hash": 10791646239315522926,
      "context_hash": 5824082284494366710,
      "translation": "따옴표로 묶인 문자열은 종단 기호입니다. `|`는 대안을 구분하고, `[ X ]`는 생략 가능함을, `{ X }`는 0회 이상의 반복을 뜻합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "strings": "문자열"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Parentheses group grammar expressions.",
      "source_hash": 4258088648127586648,
      "context_hash": 18223662597999470042,
      "translation": "괄호는 문법 표현식을 묶습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "expressions": "식",
        "grammar": "문법"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Quoted brackets and braces are literal tokens. `varid`, `conid`, and literal tokens are defined in the lexical section.",
      "source_hash": 17425429634773188085,
      "context_hash": 8003959279388678110,
      "translation": "따옴표로 묶인 대괄호와 중괄호는 리터럴 토큰입니다. `varid`, `conid`, 리터럴 토큰은 어휘 절에서 정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "literal": "리터럴",
        "tokens": "토큰"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "An unbraced source file receives an outer layout block, so both styles have the same `program` production.",
      "source_hash": 6600735910748174029,
      "context_hash": 6197512420103951963,
      "translation": "중괄호가 없는 소스 파일은 바깥쪽 레이아웃 블록을 받으므로, 두 스타일 모두 같은 `program` 생성 규칙을 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "layout": "레이아웃",
        "source file": "소스 파일"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912210Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Declarations",
      "source_hash": 9685814742647910932,
      "context_hash": 15157738492294606436,
      "translation": "선언",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "declarations": "선언"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A record declaration has exactly one constructor.",
      "source_hash": 15706292541310458678,
      "context_hash": 14568598227940141024,
      "translation": "레코드 선언은 정확히 하나의 생성자를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "constructor": "생성자",
        "declaration": "선언"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Its labels are distinct, but other record types may reuse them.",
      "source_hash": 6461244369153603569,
      "context_hash": 1230669847105714071,
      "translation": "레코드의 레이블은 서로 달라야 하지만, 다른 레코드 타입이 같은 레이블을 다시 쓸 수는 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "record types": "레코드 타입"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Instance-head variables are distinct and the context mentions only those variables.",
      "source_hash": 2118282147591561705,
      "context_hash": 5332393796587783553,
      "translation": "인스턴스 헤드의 변수는 서로 달라야 하며, 컨텍스트는 그 변수들만 언급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "instance": "인스턴스",
        "variables": "변수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Fixity declarations occur only at the top level, with precedence `0` through `9`.",
      "source_hash": 2952626271014007572,
      "context_hash": 2816628297718158342,
      "translation": "결합성 선언은 최상위 수준에서만 나타나며, 우선순위는 `0`부터 `9`까지입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "declarations": "선언",
        "fixity": "결합성",
        "precedence": "우선순위"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "The only deriving classes are `Eq`, `Ord`, and `Show`.",
      "source_hash": 3752922711972538287,
      "context_hash": 14645899508007048801,
      "translation": "deriving할 수 있는 클래스는 `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "classes": "클래스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:5",
      "source": "Pattern bindings are nonrecursive.",
      "source_hash": 5885383625707328197,
      "context_hash": 10893833057921458261,
      "translation": "패턴 바인딩은 재귀적이지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pattern bindings": "패턴 바인딩"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912211Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:6",
      "source": "A recursive binding must become a function after desugaring.",
      "source_hash": 1174334918196102976,
      "context_hash": 12588528291689763725,
      "translation": "재귀 바인딩은 디슈거링 후에 함수가 되어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "desugaring": "디슈거링",
        "function": "함수",
        "recursive binding": "재귀 바인딩"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Expressions",
      "source_hash": 12338871601998503977,
      "context_hash": 8064543452956775073,
      "translation": "표현식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "expressions": "식"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A block's last `do` statement must be an expression.",
      "source_hash": 13556929449859721889,
      "context_hash": 17587638868401491218,
      "translation": "블록의 마지막 `do` 문장은 표현식이어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "expression": "식"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "A bare constructor followed by a record brace is construction, not update.",
      "source_hash": 8375902411295121946,
      "context_hash": 14237463143367590118,
      "translation": "맨 생성자 뒤에 레코드 중괄호가 오면 갱신이 아니라 생성입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "constructor": "생성자"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Construction requires every field exactly once.",
      "source_hash": 11065336432138357814,
      "context_hash": 2502665909384836654,
      "translation": "생성에는 모든 필드가 정확히 한 번씩 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "field": "필드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Updates preserve the record's type.",
      "source_hash": 13404205940275491203,
      "context_hash": 18043397533818782467,
      "translation": "갱신은 레코드의 타입을 보존합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "type": "타입"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "Tuples have arity two or three. `(- e)` is negation rather than a right section. `(&&)` and `(||)` are accepted as values, but these operators cannot be redefined.",
      "source_hash": 3945638008585489901,
      "context_hash": 15458940238008880428,
      "translation": "튜플의 항수는 2 또는 3입니다. `(- e)`는 오른쪽 섹션이 아니라 부정입니다. `(&&)`와 `(||)`는 값으로 쓸 수 있지만, 이 연산자들은 재정의할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "arity": "항수",
        "negation": "부정",
        "operators": "연산자",
        "tuples": "튜플"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Projection and update bind tighter than application.",
      "source_hash": 8810332703244296031,
      "context_hash": 5227063568682086321,
      "translation": "프로젝션과 갱신은 적용보다 더 강하게 결합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "application": "적용",
        "projection": "프로젝션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Thus `f r.x` means `f (r.x)`.",
      "source_hash": 8453972938248241359,
      "context_hash": 16128779599104736913,
      "translation": "따라서 `f r.x`는 `f (r.x)`를 뜻합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Application associates left.",
      "source_hash": 9338624659051880719,
      "context_hash": 16435788666440346381,
      "translation": "적용은 왼쪽으로 결합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "application": "적용"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Arrow types associate right.",
      "source_hash": 5824545051540397079,
      "context_hash": 16503119671302952645,
      "translation": "화살표 타입은 오른쪽으로 결합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "types": "타입"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:4",
      "source": "An operator chain is resolved using the declarations in scope, with `infixl 9` as the default.",
      "source_hash": 9909142629503595251,
      "context_hash": 13051369434706607093,
      "translation": "연산자 연쇄는 스코프 안의 선언을 사용해 해석하며, 기본값은 `infixl 9`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "declarations": "선언",
        "operator chain": "연산자 연쇄",
        "scope": "스코프"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:5",
      "source": "Unary minus follows Haskell's precedence-six rule.",
      "source_hash": 5893590751900133776,
      "context_hash": 9253189928425631449,
      "translation": "단항 마이너스는 Haskell의 우선순위 6 규칙을 따릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Haskell": "Haskell",
        "Unary minus": "단항 마이너스",
        "precedence": "우선순위"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:6",
      "source": "Conflicting associativities at equal precedence require parentheses.",
      "source_hash": 16754723766216795712,
      "context_hash": 15478243451632521552,
      "translation": "같은 우선순위에서 결합 방향이 충돌하면 괄호가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "precedence": "우선순위"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The Prelude supplies these fixities:",
      "source_hash": 15256431818219040807,
      "context_hash": 8392719434620805791,
      "translation": "Prelude는 다음과 같은 결합성을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Prelude": "Prelude",
        "fixities": "결합성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:02:16.912213Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Associativity",
